action:
Use case: stylized-concept. Asset: eight-frame transparent 2D animation sprite sheet for CANCEL CITY's Master Cheese. Reference image 1 is the exact official card style and identity; reference image 2 is the existing full-body actor construction and gun. Create a NEW sheet, not a card illustration.
LAYOUT: exactly eight full-body intact soldier figures, FOUR equal columns by TWO equal rows on a genuinely transparent canvas. Equal cell size, generous clear gutters, each figure's entire helmet, boots and grater rifle inside its own cell. No touching neighboring figures. Consistent scale, facing screen-right in 3/4 view.
IDENTITY LOCK: the same short thickset cheddar-yellow sci-fi armored soldier in every pose. Large Swiss-cheese holes and dripping cheese on helmet, chest, shoulders and legs, black undersuit, angry ridiculous green face visible through one lime-green visor, rounded cheese armor, big silver rectangular box-grater rifle with many circular grating holes and cheddar around the muzzle. Dense ugly scratchy etched black lines, gritty crosshatching and stippling, acid-neon details. Match the reference's hand-made grotesque parody style; no clean vector, polished anime, painterly glossy rendering or realistic 3D.
FRAME ORDER left-to-right across top, then bottom:
1 calm ready stance with grater rifle low;
2 notices heat, worried eyes, slight flinch while keeping rifle low;
3 raises very heavy grater rifle halfway, shoulders tense;
4 aims grater rifle toward screen-right, feet planted;
5 first firing recoil, torso pushed backwards, rifle muzzle slightly rising;
6 peak firing recoil, torso leans farther back and knees bend;
7 recoil recovers, rifle lower and face exhausted;
8 firm followthrough, forward lean, rifle trained screen-right, proud furious face.
Only intact actor and held gun, some connected cheese drips. NO muzzle flash, projectile, smoke, aura, ground shadow, background, floor, scenery, text, labels, card frame or watermark. Transparent outside each figure. Full boots present.

ending:
Use case: stylized-concept. Asset: a transparent eight-frame animation sprite sheet for CANCEL CITY's Master Cheese. The provided images are identity/style references only. Match exact cheddar armor, lime green visor face, silver grater gun, grotesque dense etched black crosshatching.
Create exactly EIGHT whole-body figures in FOUR COLUMNS and TWO ROWS, equal spacious cells, full boots and helmet and held grater inside each cell, no overlap, generous transparent gutters. Consistent scale and facing screen-right in 3/4 view. True alpha background, zero colored background.
Character: bulky cheddar-orange yellow sci-fi armored soldier with melted Swiss-cheese holes and dripping armor on black undersuit, angry ridiculous green face behind bright lime visor; giant rectangular silver box-grater rifle with many round holes. Gritty scratchy hatching, etched stippled cheap print texture, uglier funny card illustration rather than clean anime. Keep one intact body per pose, feet/arms attached, same helmet and gun construction.
Read LEFT TO RIGHT top row then bottom row:
1 huge proud heroic salute with right hand at helmet, left hand holding rifle down beside left leg;
2 same salute but alarmed sweaty expression, armor gets softer;
3 salute lowers halfway, knees wobble while he stays upright;
4 knees deeply buckle, body squats, still grips gun down by leg;
5 tries to straighten legs and salvage dignity, worried green face;
6 sinks back down, shoulders sag, cheese armor drips more while still recognizable and intact;
7 heroic deep crouch with sad face, grater planted beside one foot, slightly melted suit but both boots and hands and helmet clearly connected;
8 pitiful victorious final salute from low crouch, very sad green face, gun held down in other hand, cheddar drips connected to armor.
No detached cheese puddles or particles. NO scenery, floor, shadow, aura, flash, text, labels, card borders, watermark. Only eight isolated intact actor figures on transparency.
